o changes: `useEffect(() => { const unsub = subscribeToChanges(fetchBudget); return unsub; }, [subscribeToChanges, fetchBudget]);`\n3. **Update `client/src/components/ExpenseSummary.jsx`**:\n   - Import `useDataSync` and `getCurrencySymbol`.\n   - `const currency = getCurrencySymbol(user?.currency);`\n   - Subscribe to changes: `useEffect(() => { const unsub = subscribeToChanges(fetchSummary); return unsub; }, [subscribeToChanges, fetchSummary]);`\n4. **Update `client/src/components/AIFeatures.jsx`**:\n   - Import `getCurrencySymbol`.\n   - `const currency = getCurrencySymbol(user?.currency);`\n5. **Update `client/src/components/Navbar.jsx`**:\n   - In the Profile edit modal, ensure `CURRENCIES` from `../utils/currency` is used in the dropdown with PKR included.\n6. **Update `client/src/components/NotificationsDrawer.jsx`**:\n   - Add a \"Send Test Email\" button connecting to `POST /api/notifications/test-email` with feedback toast so user `humaakhan65@gmail.com` can test real delivery anytime.\n7. **Rebuild Client Assets**:\n   - Run `npm run build` in `client/` to compile assets to `client/dist`.\n8. **End-to-End Verification**:\n   - Update and run `test-e2e.js`:\n     * Verify server starts without error (`node server/index.js`).\n     * Verify user registration defaults to `PKR`.\n     * Verify bill add/delete, expense add/delete, pantry adjustment, and budget changes update UI and calculations immediately.\n     * Verify email scheduler triggers and test email endpoint works.\n     * Verify instructions for configuring Gmail App Password in `.env` are clearly presented to the user.\n\nYou have the 2 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: implementation_plan]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/HP/.gemini/antigravity/brain/eebec2ed-3589-4249-aadf-408a444636c0/implementation_plan.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-02T15:23:53Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: walkthrough]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/HP/.gemini/antigravity/brain/eebec2ed-3589-4249-aadf-408a444636c0/walkthroug